#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Contacts, companies and your own details as .vcf cards, and a card file read in. Switched off, the downloads and the import are not offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "Kontaktid, ettevõtted ja teie enda andmed .vcf-kaartidena ning kaardifaili sisselugemine. Välja lülitatuna allalaadimisi ja importi ei pakuta ning nende aadressid vastavad nii, nagu poleks seal midagi."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "DOCX"
msgstr "DOCX"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Extend file formats"
msgstr "Täiendavad failivormingud"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "GeoJSON"
msgstr "GeoJSON"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "iCalendar"
msgstr "iCalendar"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "ODT"
msgstr "ODT"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "OpenDocument text: a CV or a letter downloaded as an .odt file, and the text of an .odt you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "OpenDocumenti tekst: CV või kaaskiri allalaaditavana .odt-failina ning teie üles laaditud .odt-faili tekst salvestatuna, et otsing selle leiaks. Välja lülitatuna allalaadimist ei pakuta ja üles laaditud faili teksti ei loeta."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "PDF"
msgstr "PDF"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The companies' places as a GeoJSON file, out, and points read in that place a company's address by hand once you have ticked them. It needs Maps. Switched off, neither is offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "Ettevõtete asukohad GeoJSON-failina väljapoole ning sisseloetud punktid, mis paigutavad ettevõtte aadressi käsitsi, kui olete need märkinud. Selleks on vaja Kaarte. Välja lülitatuna ei pakuta kumbagi ja nende aadressid vastavad nii, nagu poleks seal midagi."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The file formats Postulo can read and write besides its own: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard and Europass. This is the switch for all of them at once; each can still be switched off on its own while this is on, and PDF cannot be. Switched off, nothing is offered in those formats and nothing is deleted: the files you have, and the data they were made from, stay."
msgstr "Failivormingud, mida Postulo oskab lisaks enda omale lugeda ja kirjutada: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard ja Europass. See on lüliti kõigi jaoks korraga; igaühe saab eraldi välja lülitada ka siis, kui see on sees, välja arvatud PDF. Välja lülitatuna ei pakuta nendes vormingutes midagi ja midagi ei kustutata: teie failid ja andmed, millest need tehti, jäävad alles."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The format a CV and a letter are made in: tagged, so a screen reader can read it. Always on; Postulo has nothing else that would still be a CV."
msgstr "Vorming, milles CV ja kaaskiri luuakse: märgendatud, et ekraanilugeja saaks seda lugeda. Alati sees; Postulol pole midagi muud, mis oleks endiselt CV."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "vCard"
msgstr "vCard"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Word documents: a CV or a letter downloaded as a .docx file, and the text of a .docx you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "Wordi dokumendid: CV või kaaskiri allalaaditavana .docx-failina ning teie üles laaditud .docx-faili tekst salvestatuna, et otsing selle leiaks. Välja lülitatuna allalaadimist ei pakuta ja üles laaditud faili teksti ei loeta."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Your calendar as .ics files and feeds, and a calendar file read in. Switched off, the downloads, the import and the feeds are not offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there; they answer again, at the same address, when it is switched on."
msgstr "Teie kalender .ics-failide ja voogudena ning kalendrifaili sisselugemine. Välja lülitatuna allalaadimisi, importi ja vooge ei pakuta ning nende aadressid vastavad nii, nagu poleks seal midagi; sisselülitamisel vastavad nad samal aadressil taas."
